WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.024 --> 00:00:04.887
"This is terrible!" said Mayor Bloom.

2
00:00:04.888 --> 00:00:09.125
"The Ultra Car is destroying the city!"

3
00:00:09.126 --> 00:00:12.876
"My poor Ruby!" cried Mrs. Cash.

4
00:00:12.877 --> 00:00:16.681
"My poor car!" cried the inventor.

5
00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:19.532
"My poor city!" cried Mayor Bloom.

6
00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:23.066
"Rocket Girl!" said Detective Smith.

7
00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:26.180
"You must . . . Rocket Girl?"

8
00:00:26.181 --> 00:00:29.893
Zoom! Roxy shot through the air.

9
00:00:29.894 --> 00:00:33.113
She flew toward downtown as fast as she could.

10
00:00:33.114 --> 00:00:37.944
Up ahead, she saw black smoke fill the sky.

11
00:00:37.945 --> 00:00:41.239
"Something's burning!" thought Roxy.

12
00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:44.612
She used her super vision to see through the smoke.

13
00:00:44.613 --> 00:00:46.969
Cars were burning in the street.

14
00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:49.446
A building was on fire too.

15
00:00:49.447 --> 00:00:52.700
A fruit cart lay on its side.

16
00:00:52.701 --> 00:00:55.538
Several store windows had been smashed.

17
00:00:55.539 --> 00:00:59.172
A sleek car rocketed down West Street.

18
00:00:59.173 --> 00:01:02.151
It had wings and rockets.

19
00:01:02.152 --> 00:01:05.578
"That must be the Ultra Car!" thought Roxy.

20
00:01:05.579 --> 00:01:09.538
Whoosh! She flew toward it.

21
00:01:09.539 --> 00:01:13.098
Crash! The car smashed a donut stand.

22
00:01:13.099 --> 00:01:15.432
Donuts flew everywhere.

23
00:01:15.433 --> 00:01:18.086
"Ugh!" cried the donut maker.

24
00:01:18.087 --> 00:01:23.447
"It took me all morning to make those donuts!"

25
00:01:23.448 --> 00:01:25.852
Roxy used her super vision again.

26
00:01:25.853 --> 00:01:30.327
She peered into the Ultra Car and saw a young girl.

27
00:01:30.328 --> 00:01:33.738
The girl wore diamond sunglasses.

28
00:01:33.739 --> 00:01:37.462
"That's Ruby Cash," thought Roxy.

29
00:01:37.463 --> 00:01:42.686
The car swerved all over the street. Ruby laughed.

30
00:01:42.687 --> 00:01:45.094
Roxy flew alongside the car.

31
00:01:45.095 --> 00:01:48.592
"Ruby, stop the car!" she cried.

32
00:01:48.593 --> 00:01:54.713
"No way!" cried Ruby. "This is fun!"

33
00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:56.323
Smash!

34
00:01:56.324 --> 00:01:59.450
The Ultra Car crashed through a fountain.

35
00:01:59.451 --> 00:02:02.157
Startled pigeons flew everywhere.

36
00:02:02.158 --> 00:02:06.275
"Woo-hoo!" shouted Ruby as the car zoomed forward.

37
00:02:06.276 --> 00:02:13.383
Screech! The Ultra Car skidded back onto the street.

38
00:02:13.384 --> 00:02:17.886
It almost hit a woman carrying a cat.

39
00:02:17.887 --> 00:02:20.954
"Crazy driver!" the woman shouted.

40
00:02:20.955 --> 00:02:23.167
"Watch where you're going!"

41
00:02:23.168 --> 00:02:26.288
"Meow!" yelped the cat.

42
00:02:26.289 --> 00:02:30.224
"Don't yell at me!" Ruby shouted.

43
00:02:30.225 --> 00:02:36.077
"I have to stop that car before someone gets hurt!" said Roxy.

44
00:02:36.078 --> 00:02:40.051
She flew ahead of the Ultra Car and landed in the street.

45
00:02:40.052 --> 00:02:43.595
She held up her hands as the car raced toward her.

46
00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:49.583
Zap! Zap! Laser beams shot from the car's headlights and blasted Roxy.

47
00:02:49.584 --> 00:02:52.898
She tumbled backward and crashed into a mailbox.

48
00:02:52.899 --> 00:02:56.821
"This car is totally fabulous," said Ruby.

49
00:02:56.822 --> 00:03:03.391
"I'll tell Mother to buy it for me. I don't care how much it costs—oh no!"

50
00:03:03.392 --> 00:03:05.526
Roxy jumped to her feet.

51
00:03:05.527 --> 00:03:09.365
The Ultra Car was racing straight toward a bus.

52
00:03:09.366 --> 00:03:13.890
Roxy could see Terrell, Jack, and Mara on the bus.

53
00:03:13.891 --> 00:03:20.272
"Rocket Girl, help!" cried Ruby. "I can't stop this car!"

54
00:03:20.273 --> 00:03:27.674
Roxy gulped. "Ruby's going to crash into my friends!"

